{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/extras/1.gif?t=1746115575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break from the hustle and bustle of the city by walking through a picturesque forest. Enjoy nature, pick mushrooms and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of tranquility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest paths hide many secrets. Explore every corner, find rare species of mushrooms and become a true connoisseur of mycology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/extras/2.gif?t=1746115575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know the world of mushroom hunter. In the demo version of the game you will have access to training and the first location of the game &quot;Old Quarry&quot; where you will have access to 11 tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore seven different locations with their unique places and vegetation, varied weather and mushroom picking conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features 32 popular types of mushrooms with their own growing areas. Each mushroom has several stages of growth, its own unique quality level and weight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete various tasks, participate in festivals and mushroom picking competitions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your basket and knife to collect more mushrooms and get more experience and coins.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574420?t=1746115575","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/064759f03f95364cb57a00b3c3cf2b03d70a9d7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746115575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/2d934573921155eacef0b35344d2daf6878ad5c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746115575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/2d934573921155eacef0b35344d2daf6878ad5c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746115575","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/extras/1.gif?t=1746115575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a break from the hustle and bustle of the city by walking through a picturesque forest. Enjoy nature, pick mushrooms and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of tranquility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forest paths hide many secrets. Explore every corner, find rare species of mushrooms and become a true connoisseur of mycology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/extras/2.gif?t=1746115575\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know the world of mushroom hunter. In the demo version of the game you will have access to training and the first location of the game &quot;Old Quarry&quot; where you will have access to 11 tasks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore seven different locations with their unique places and vegetation, varied weather and mushroom picking conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features 32 popular types of mushrooms with their own growing areas. Each mushroom has several stages of growth, its own unique quality level and weight.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete various tasks, participate in festivals and mushroom picking competitions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your basket and knife to collect more mushrooms and get more experience and coins.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Poroshin Develop"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3262810","name":"Mushroom Hunter World"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574420/81506f8c612492f5071dafe76860acaa8581c979/header.jpg?t=1746115575","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132285,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132285/movie480.mp4?t=1746115573","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132285/movie_max.mp4?t=1746115573"},"name":"Mushroom Hunter World - Announcement Trailer (PC)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132285/066d0fa9f561fe9522ab8ac306cdcb611b2d9d94/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746115573","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132285/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746115573","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132285/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746115573"}}],"name":"Mushroom Hunter World Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 9100F / AMD\u00ae Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650 / AMD Radeon RX 6400</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 12400F / AMD\u00ae Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<